    {
      "id": "song-292",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "采桑子",
      "subtitle": "清明上巳西湖好",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "清明上巳西湖好，满目繁华。争道谁家。绿柳朱轮走钿车。\n游人日暮相将去，醒醉喧哗。路转堤斜。直到城头总是花。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "54b8e6a304bc3303e3942fe4e684c7c3e27ba4030646ba725b4224eae624e2c7",
      "estimatedOutput": 706,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-292--54b8e6a304bc3303e3942fe4e684c7c3e27ba4030646ba725b4224eae624e2c7.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-293",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "声声慢",
      "subtitle": "秋声",
      "author": "蒋捷",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "黄花深巷，红叶低窗，凄凉一片秋声。豆雨声来，中间夹带风声。疏疏二十五点，丽谯门、不锁更声。故人远，问谁摇玉佩，檐底铃声？\n彩角声吹月堕，渐连营马动，四起笳声。闪烁邻灯，灯前尚有砧声。知他诉愁到晓，碎哝哝、多少蛩声！诉未了，把一半、分与雁声。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9a5454beb5bf5396d1d499faa39b88dc03209bca3eadba26a10a1e420a2eb0f8",
      "estimatedOutput": 840,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-293--9a5454beb5bf5396d1d499faa39b88dc03209bca3eadba26a10a1e420a2eb0f8.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-294",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "斗草阶前初见",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "斗草阶前初见，穿针楼上曾逢。罗裙香露玉钗风。靓妆眉沁绿，羞脸粉生红。\n流水便随春远，行云终与谁同。酒醒长恨锦屏空。相寻梦里路，飞雨落花中。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "8d4c97bf3696a1ba3744c799818392a8d3833ff7d3ee99b1ad5662f8997b6cfb",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-294--8d4c97bf3696a1ba3744c799818392a8d3833ff7d3ee99b1ad5662f8997b6cfb.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-295",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "鹧鸪天",
      "subtitle": "别情",
      "author": "聂胜琼",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "玉惨花愁出凤城，莲花楼下柳青青。尊前一唱阳关曲，别个人人第五程。\n寻好梦，梦难成。有谁知我此时情，枕前泪共阶前雨，隔个窗儿滴到明。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a6314fd0b3c59d53f79eec81a26174dbd11377e064da8e5caec473fb0db7c038",
      "estimatedOutput": 730,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-295--a6314fd0b3c59d53f79eec81a26174dbd11377e064da8e5caec473fb0db7c038.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-296",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "回文秋闺怨",
      "author": "苏轼",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "井桐双照新妆冷，冷妆新照双桐井。羞对井花愁，愁花井对羞。\n影孤怜夜永，永夜怜孤影。楼上不宜秋，秋宜不上楼。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f00001055a16dc3481e69f50e0ff9f11f39b9e83b44f0dac25f65b4ee892400d",
      "estimatedOutput": 706,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-296--f00001055a16dc3481e69f50e0ff9f11f39b9e83b44f0dac25f65b4ee892400d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-297",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "望海潮",
      "subtitle": "洛阳怀古",
      "author": "秦观",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "梅英疏淡，冰澌溶泄，东风暗换年华。金谷俊游，铜驼巷陌，新晴细履平沙。长记误随车。正絮翻蝶舞，芳思交加。柳下桃蹊，乱分春色到人家。\n西园夜饮鸣笳。有华灯碍月，飞盖妨花。兰苑未空，行人渐老，重来是事堪嗟。烟暝酒旗斜。但倚楼极目，时见栖鸦。无奈归心，暗随流水到天涯。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ce10da75d570b717011b88a8cd039e34c9b9d85b79146d2cdffd16f2a8a6a951",
      "estimatedOutput": 860,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-297--ce10da75d570b717011b88a8cd039e34c9b9d85b79146d2cdffd16f2a8a6a951.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-298",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "长相思",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "陈允平",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "风萧萧。雨骚骚。风雨萧骚梧叶飘。潇湘江畔楼。\n云迢迢。水遥遥。云水迢遥天尽头。相思心上秋。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "1ae0b31e21f9a12b1eff529ced787ac32fd0711ed2aa80504bdff7284cb4875d",
      "estimatedOutput": 690,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-298--1ae0b31e21f9a12b1eff529ced787ac32fd0711ed2aa80504bdff7284cb4875d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-299",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "雪似梅花",
      "author": "吕本中",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "雪似梅花，梅花似雪。似和不似都奇绝。恼人风味阿谁知？请君问取南楼月。\n记得去年，探梅时节。老来旧事无人说。为谁醉倒为谁醒？到今犹恨轻离别。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f735b3acac92bf052686bde30987b12f128ccde99b27cefa0324cfe7ab054792",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-299--f735b3acac92bf052686bde30987b12f128ccde99b27cefa0324cfe7ab054792.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-300",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "记得金銮同唱第",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "记得金銮同唱第，春风上国繁华。如今薄宦老天涯。十年岐路，空负曲江花。\n闻说阆山通阆苑，楼高不见君家。孤城寒日等闲斜。离愁难尽，红树远连霞。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ca152632ce2fb404a0b3dfd2b109bbf5835167cf6d5715e3d16313fe27ba0b43",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-300--ca152632ce2fb404a0b3dfd2b109bbf5835167cf6d5715e3d16313fe27ba0b43.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-301",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "卜算子",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "蔡伸",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "春事付莺花，曾是莺花主。醉拍春衫金缕衣，只向花间住。\n密意君听取。莫逐风来去。若是真心待于飞，云里千条路。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "bfa0dd993de5dc8b823720fc6c24c99b23122451007219a6bfe37cfdd6568aea",
